{"id":"beira","lemma":"beira","pos":"noun","rank":2697,"glosses":["edge, margin, border"],"ipa":"/ˈbe(j).ɾɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"beiras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Wiktionairy-beira.wav","formAudio":{"beiras":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-Beiras.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Gostaria de ir à beira-mar?","en":"Would you like to go to the seaside?","words":[{"g":"to like","l":"gostar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"forms adverbs meaning…"},null,{"g":"sea"}]},{"text":"Tom está à beira da morte.","en":"Tom is on the verge of dying.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"forms adverbs meaning…"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"death"}]},{"text":"Tom estava sentado na beira da cama.","en":"Tom was sitting on the edge of the bed.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"seated"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"bed"}]},{"text":"Ela esteve à beira do suicídio.","en":"She was on the verge of killing herself.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"forms adverbs meaning…"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"suicide"}]},{"text":"Alguns meninos brincavam à beira-rio.","en":"There were some boys playing near the river.","words":[{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},{"g":"boy","l":"menino"},{"g":"to play","l":"brincar"},{"g":"forms adverbs meaning…"},null,{"g":"river"}]}]}